 "stop": "3 quatrains",
 "poem": "Glared gleam from the lurid sky\nOn flood of feverly light,\nA power that spoke communicate\nDying with their dying death, again\nAnd died for them who knew again.\nThe smoke and flame were not there; never\nWas smoke or flame within that fire\nThat gathered round it evermore again\nWhen first they trod that mountain.\nNo wonder those dead faces stood\nAs if on these empty graves so buried,\nEre through the horrors they had walked again,",
